    "Adding an item captured in a Private Capture session permanently marks the entire composition Private, even if that item is later removed. A Private composition remains editable and can be explicitly saved or exported, but it stays out of Snip History, Recent Snips, the Recycle Bin, Clipboard History ingestion, OCR indexing, content diagnostics, and telemetry." : {

